e conferring over you [intending] to kill you, so leave [the city]; indeed, I am to you of the sincere advisors.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَجَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَjgَw", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَجُلٌ", "translit": "ٌlُjgَr", "root": "رجل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَقْصَا", "translit": "āَṣْqَaʾ", "root": "قصو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمَدِينَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَnyِdَmْlٱ", "root": "مدن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يَسْعَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَʿعْsَy", "root": "سعي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلْمَلَأَ", "translit": "َaʾَlَmْlٱ", "root": "ملا"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يَأْتَمِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِmَtْaʾَy", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "بِكَ", "translit": "َkِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "لِيَقْتُلُوكَ", "translit": "َkwُlُtْqَyِl", "root": "قتل"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "فَٱخْرُجْ", "translit": "ْjgُrْhkٱَf", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "لَكَ", "translit": "َkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱلنَّٰصِحِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥِṣَّٰnlٱ", "root": "نصح"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 21, "text": "فَخَرَجَ مِنْهَا خَآئِفًا يَتَرَقَّبُۖ قَالَ رَبِّ نَجِّنِى مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ ", "translation": "So he left it, fearful and anticipating [apprehension]. He said, \"My Lord, save me from the wrongdoing people.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَخَرَجَ", "translit": "َjgَrَhkَf", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنْهَا", "translit": "āَhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "خَآئِفًا", "translit": "āًfِyʾٓāَhk", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَتَرَقَّبُ", "translit": "ُbَّqَrَtَy", "root": "رقب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "نَجِّنِى", "translit": "àِnِّjgَn", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْقَوْمِ", "translit": "ِmْwَqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 22, "text": "وَلَمَّا تَوَجَّهَ تِلْقَآءَ مَدْيَنَ قَالَ عَسَىٰ رَبِّىٓ أَن يَهْدِيَنِى سَوَآءَ ٱلسَّبِيلِ ", "translation": "And when he directed himself toward Madyan, he said, \"Perhaps my Lord will guide me to the sound way.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَوَجَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّjgَwَt", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تِلْقَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَqْlِt", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَدْيَنَ", "translit": "َnَyْdَm", "root": "مدن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَsَʿع", "root": "عسي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "رَبِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يَهْدِيَنِى", "translit": "àِnَyِdْhَy", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "سَوَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَwَs", "root": "سوي"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلسَّبِيلِ", "translit": "ِlyِbَّslٱ", "root": "سبل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 23, "text": "وَلَمَّا وَرَدَ مَآءَ مَدْيَنَ وَجَدَ عَلَيْهِ أُمَّةً مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ يَسْقُونَ وَوَجَدَ مِن دُونِهِمُ ٱمْرَأَتَيْنِ تَذُودَانِۖ قَالَ مَا خَطْبُكُمَاۖ قَالَتَا لَا نَسْقِى حَتَّىٰ يُصْدِرَ ٱلرِّعَآءُۖ وَأَبُونَا شَيْخٌ كَبِيرٌ ", "translation": "And when he came to the water [i.e., well] of Madyan, he found there a crowd of people watering [their flocks], and he found aside from them two women holding back [their flocks]. He said, \"What is your circumstance?\" They said, \"We do not water until the shepherds dispatch [their flocks]; and our father is an old man.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَرَدَ", "translit": "َdَrَw", "root": "ورد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَm", "root": "موه"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَدْيَنَ", "translit": "َnَyْdَm", "root": "مدن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَجَدَ", "translit": "َdَjgَw", "root": "وجد"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أُمَّةً", "translit": "ًẗَّmُaʾ", "root": "امم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "يَسْقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqْsَy", "root": "سقي"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَوَجَدَ", "translit": "َdَjgَwَw", "root": "وجد"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "دُونِهِمُ", "translit": "ُmِhِnwُd", "root": "دون"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱمْرَأَتَيْنِ", "translit": "ِnْyَtَaʾَrْmٱ", "root": "مرا"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "تَذُودَانِ", "translit": "ِnāَdwُhdَt", "root": "ذود"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "خَطْبُكُمَا", "translit": "āَmُkُbْṭَhk", "root": "خطب"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "قَالَتَا", "translit": "āَtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "نَسْقِى", "translit": "àِqْsَn", "root": "سقي"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "حَتَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّtَḥ", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "يُصْدِرَ", "translit": "َrِdْṣُy", "root": "صدر"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "ٱلرِّعَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَʿعِّrlٱ", "root": "رعي"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "وَأَبُونَا", "translit": "āَnwُbَaʾَw", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "شَيْخٌ", "translit": "ٌhkْyَhs", "root": "شيخ"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "كَبِيرٌ", "translit": "ٌryِbَk", "root": "كبر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 24, "text": "فَسَقَىٰ لَهُمَا ثُمَّ تَوَلَّىٰٓ إِلَى ٱلظِّلِّ فَقَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّى لِمَآ أَنزَلْتَ إِلَىَّ مِنْ خَيْرٍ فَقِيرٌ ", "translation": "So he watered [their flocks] for them; then he went back to the shade and said, \"My Lord, indeed I am, for whatever good You would send down to me, in need.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَسَقَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَqَsَf", "root": "سقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَهُمَا", "translit": "āَmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَوَلَّىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَّlَwَt", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَى", "translit": "àَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلظِّلِّ", "translit": "ِّlِّẓlٱ", "root": "ظلل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَقَالَ", "translit": "َlāَqَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لِمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "أَنزَلْتَ", "translit": "َtْlَznَaʾ", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "إِلَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "خَيْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْyَhk", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "فَقِيرٌ", "translit": "ٌryِqَf", "root": "فقر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 25, "text": "فَجَآءَتْهُ إِحْدَىٰهُمَا تَمْشِى عَلَى ٱسْتِحْيَآءٍ قَالَتْ إِنَّ أَبِى يَدْعُوكَ لِيَجْزِيَكَ أَجْرَ مَا سَقَيْتَ لَنَاۚ فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُۥ وَقَصَّ عَلَيْهِ ٱلْقَصَصَ قَالَ لَا تَخَفْۖ نَجَوْتَ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ ", "translation": "Then one of the two women came to him walking with shyness. She said, \"Indeed, my father invites you that he may reward you for having watered for us.\" So when he came to him[1] and related to him the story, he said, \"Fear not. You have escaped from the wrongdoing people.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَجَآءَتْهُ", "translit": "ُhْtَءٓāَjgَf", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِحْدَىٰهُمَا", "translit": "āَmُhٰàَdْḥِiʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تَمْشِى", "translit": "àِhsْmَt", "root": "مشي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱسْتِحْيَآءٍ", "translit": "ٍءٓāَyْḥِtْsٱ", "root": "حيي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "قَالَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَبِى", "translit": "àِbَaʾ", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يَدْعُوكَ", "translit": "َkwُʿعْdَy", "root": "دعو"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لِيَجْزِيَكَ", "translit": "َkَyِzْjgَyِl", "root": "جزي"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "أَجْرَ", "translit": "َrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "سَقَيْتَ", "translit": "َtْyَqَs", "root": "سقي"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "لَنَا", "translit": "āَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "جَآءَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "وَقَصَّ", "translit": "َّṣَqَw", "root": "قصص"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ٱلْقَصَصَ", "translit": "َṣَṣَqْlٱ", "root": "قصص"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "تَخَفْ", "translit": "ْfَhkَt", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "نَجَوْتَ", "translit": "َtْwَjgَn", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلْقَوْمِ", "translit": "ِmْwَqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 26, "text": "قَالَتْ إِحْدَىٰهُمَا يَٰٓأَبَتِ ٱسْتَـْٔجِرْهُۖ إِنَّ خَيْرَ مَنِ ٱسْتَـْٔجَرْتَ ٱلْقَوِىُّ ٱلْأَمِينُ ", "translation": "One of the women said, \"O my father, hire him. Indeed, the best one you can hire is the strong and the trustworthy.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِحْدَىٰهُمَا", "translit": "āَmُhٰàَdْḥِiʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَبَتِ", "translit": "ِtَbَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱسْتَـْٔجِرْهُ", "translit": "ُhْrِjgْٔـَtْsٱ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "خَيْرَ", "translit": "َrْyَhk", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَنِ", "translit": "ِnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱسْتَـْٔجَرْتَ", "translit": "َtْrَjgْٔـَtْsٱ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْقَوِىُّ", "translit": "ُّàِwَqْlٱ", "root": "قوي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلْأَمِينُ", "translit": "ُnyِmَaʾْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 27, "text": "قَالَ إِنِّىٓ أُرِيدُ أَنْ أُنكِحَكَ إِحْدَى ٱبْنَتَىَّ هَٰتَيْنِ عَلَىٰٓ أَن تَأْجُرَنِى ثَمَٰنِىَ حِجَجٍۖ فَإِنْ أَتْمَمْتَ عَشْرًا فَمِنْ عِندِكَۖ وَمَآ أُرِيدُ أَنْ أَشُقَّ عَلَيْكَۚ سَتَجِدُنِىٓ إِن شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ ", "translation": "He said, \"Indeed, I wish to wed you one of these, my two daughters, on [the condition] that you serve me for eight years; but if you complete ten, it will be [as a favor] from you. And I do not wish to put you in difficulty. You will find me, if Allāh wills, from among the righteous.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أُرِيدُ", "translit": "ُdyِrُaʾ", "root": "رود"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أُنكِحَكَ", "translit": "َkَḥِknُaʾ", "root": "نكح"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِحْدَى", "translit": "àَdْḥِiʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱبْنَتَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَtَnْbٱ", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هَٰتَيْنِ", "translit": "ِnْyَtَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَأْجُرَنِى", "translit": "àِnَrُjgْaʾَt", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ثَمَٰنِىَ", "translit": "َàِnَٰmَht", "root": "ثمن"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "حِجَجٍ", "translit": "ٍjgَjgِḥ", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "فَإِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "أَتْمَمْتَ", "translit": "َtْmَmْtَaʾ", "root": "تمم"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "عَشْرًا", "translit": "āًrْhsَʿع", "root": "عشر"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "فَمِنْ", "translit": "ْnِmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "عِندِكَ", "translit": "َkِdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "أُرِيدُ", "translit": "ُdyِrُaʾ", "root": "رود"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "أَشُقَّ", "translit": "َّqُhsَaʾ", "root": "شقق"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "عَلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "سَتَجِدُنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnُdِjgَtَs", "root": "وجد"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "شَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَhs", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 28, "text": "قَالَ ذَٰلِكَ بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَكَۖ أَيَّمَا ٱلْأَجَلَيْنِ قَضَيْتُ فَلَا عُدْوَٰنَ عَلَىَّۖ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ مَا نَقُولُ وَكِيلٌ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"That is [established] between me and you. Whichever of the two terms I complete - there is no injustice to me, and Allāh, over what we say, is Witness.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَيْنِى", "translit": "àِnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَبَيْنَكَ", "translit": "َkَnْyَbَw", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَيَّمَا", "translit": "āَmَّyَaʾ", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْأَجَلَيْنِ", "translit": "ِnْyَlَjgَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اجل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "قَضَيْتُ", "translit": "ُtْyَḍَq", "root": "قضي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَلَا", "translit": "āَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عُدْوَٰنَ", "translit": "َnَٰwْdُʿع", "root": "عدو"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَلَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "نَقُولُ", "translit": "ُlwُqَn", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَكِيلٌ", "translit": "ٌlyِkَw", "root": "وكل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 29, "text": "فَلَمَّا قَضَىٰ مُوسَى ٱلْأَجَلَ وَسَارَ بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ ءَانَسَ مِن جَانِبِ ٱلطُّورِ نَارًا قَالَ لِأَهْلِهِ ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟ إِنِّىٓ ءَانَسْتُ نَارًا لَّعَلِّىٓ ءَاتِيكُم مِّنْهَا بِخَبَرٍ أَوْ جَذْوَةٍ مِّنَ ٱلنَّارِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَصْطَلُونَ ", "translation": "And when Moses had completed the term and was traveling with his family, he perceived from the direction of the mount a fire. He said to his family, \"Stay here; indeed, I have perceived a fire. Perhaps I will bring you from there [some] information or burning wood from the fire that you may warm yourselves.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَضَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَḍَq", "root": "قضي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مُوسَى", "translit": "àَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْأَجَلَ", "translit": "َlَjgَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اجل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَسَارَ", "translit": "َrāَsَw", "root": "سير"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِlْhَaʾِb", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ءَانَسَ", "translit": "َsَnāَء", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "جَانِبِ", "translit": "ِbِnāَjg", "root": "جنب"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلطُّورِ", "translit": "ِrwُّṭlٱ", "root": "طور"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "نَارًا", "translit": "āًrāَn", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "لِأَهْلِهِ", "translit": "ِhِlْhَaʾِl", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُhtُkْmٱ", "root": "مكث"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "إِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ءَانَسْتُ", "translit": "ُtْsَnāَء", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "نَارًا", "translit": "āًrāَn", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "لَّعَلِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّlَʿعَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ءَاتِيكُم", "translit": "mُkyِtāَء", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "مِّنْهَا", "translit": "āَhْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "بِخَبَرٍ", "translit": "ٍrَbَhkِb", "root": "خبر"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "أَوْ", "translit": "ْwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "جَذْوَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَwْhdَjg", "root": "جذو"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلنَّارِ", "translit": "ِrāَّnlٱ", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "تَصْطَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَṭْṣَt", "root": "صلي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 30, "text": "فَلَمَّآ أَتَىٰهَا نُودِىَ مِن شَٰطِئِ ٱلْوَادِ ٱلْأَيْمَنِ فِى ٱلْبُقْعَةِ ٱلْمُبَٰرَكَةِ مِنَ ٱلشَّجَرَةِ أَن يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ إِنِّىٓ أَنَا ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "But when he came to it, he was called from the right side of the valley in a blessed spot - from the tree,[1] \"O Moses, indeed I am Allāh, Lord of the worlds.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَتَىٰهَا", "translit": "āَhٰàَtَaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نُودِىَ", "translit": "َàِdwُn", "root": "ندي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "شَٰطِئِ", "translit": "ِyʾِṭَٰhs", "root": "شطا"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْوَادِ", "translit": "ِdāَwْlٱ", "root": "ودي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْأَيْمَنِ", "translit": "ِnَmْyَaʾْlٱ", "root": "يمن"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْبُقْعَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَʿعْqُbْlٱ", "root": "بقع"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلْمُبَٰرَكَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَkَrَٰbُmْlٱ", "root": "برك"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلشَّجَرَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَrَjgَّhslٱ", "root": "شجر"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "إِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "أَنَا", "translit": "āَnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "رَبُّ", "translit": "ُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 31, "text": "وَأَنْ أَلْقِ عَصَاكَۖ فَلَمَّا رَءَاهَا تَهْتَزُّ كَأَنَّهَا جَآنٌّ وَلَّىٰ مُدْبِرًا وَلَمْ يُعَقِّبْۚ يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ أَقْبِلْ وَلَا تَخَفْۖ إِنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْءَامِنِينَ ", "translation": "And [he was told], \"Throw down your staff.\" But when he saw it writhing as if it was a snake, he turned in flight and did not return.[1] [Allāh said], \"O Moses, approach and fear not. Indeed, you are of the secure.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَلْقِ", "translit": "ِqْlَaʾ", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَصَاكَ", "translit": "َkāَṣَʿع", "root": "عصو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَءَاهَا", "translit": "āَhāَءَr", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَهْتَزُّ", "translit": "ُّzَtْhَt", "root": "هزز"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "كَأَنَّهَا", "translit": "āَhَّnَaʾَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "جَآنٌّ", "translit": "ٌّnٓāَjg", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَلَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّlَw", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مُدْبِرًا", "translit": "āًrِbْdُm", "root": "دبر"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "يُعَقِّبْ", "translit": "ْbِّqَʿعُy", "root": "عقب"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "أَقْبِلْ", "translit": "ْlِbْqَaʾ", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "تَخَفْ", "translit": "ْfَhkَt", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "إِنَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ٱلْءَامِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmāَءْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 32, "text": "ٱسْلُكْ يَدَكَ فِى جَيْبِكَ تَخْرُجْ بَيْضَآءَ مِنْ غَيْرِ سُوٓءٍ وَٱضْمُمْ إِلَيْكَ جَنَاحَكَ مِنَ ٱلرَّهْبِۖ فَذَٰنِكَ بُرْهَٰنَانِ مِن رَّبِّكَ إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦٓۚ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ قَوْمًا فَٰسِقِينَ ", "translation": "Insert your hand into the opening of your garment; it will come out white, without disease. And draw in your arm close to you [as prevention] from fear, for those are two proofs from your Lord to Pharaoh and his establishment. Indeed, they have been a people defiantly disobedient.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱسْلُكْ", "translit": "ْkُlْsٱ", "root": "سلك"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَدَكَ", "translit": "َkَdَy", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "جَيْبِكَ", "translit": "َkِbْyَjg", "root": "جيب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَخْرُجْ", "translit": "ْjgُrْhkَt", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بَيْضَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَḍْyَb", "root": "بيض"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "غَيْرِ", "translit": "ِrْyَغ", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "سُوٓءٍ", "translit": "ٍءٓwُs", "root": "سوا"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَٱضْمُمْ", "translit": "ْmُmْḍٱَw", "root": "ضمم"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "إِلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "جَنَاحَكَ", "translit": "َkَḥāَnَjg", "root": "جنح"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلرَّهْبِ", "translit": "ِbْhَّrlٱ", "root": "رهب"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "فَذَٰنِكَ", "translit": "َkِnَٰhdَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "بُرْهَٰنَانِ", "translit": "ِnāَnَٰhْrُb", "root": "برهن"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "رَّبِّكَ", "translit": "َkِّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِh۟yِiʾَlَmَw", "root": "ملا"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "إِنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "قَوْمًا", "translit": "āًmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "فَٰسِقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqِsَٰf", "root": "فسق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 33, "text": "قَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّى قَتَلْتُ مِنْهُمْ نَفْسًا فَأَخَافُ أَن يَقْتُلُونِ ", "translation": "He said, \"My Lord, indeed I killed from among them someone, and I fear they will kill me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَتَلْتُ", "translit": "ُtْlَtَq", "root": "قتل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "نَفْسًا", "translit": "āًsْfَn", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَأَخَافُ", "translit": "ُfāَhkَaʾَf", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يَقْتُلُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُlُtْqَy", "root": "قتل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 34, "text": "وَأَخِى هَٰرُونُ هُوَ أَفْصَحُ مِنِّى لِسَانًا فَأَرْسِلْهُ مَعِىَ رِدْءًا يُصَدِّقُنِىٓۖ إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ أَن يُكَذِّبُونِ ", "translation": "And my brother Aaron is more fluent than me in tongue, so send him with me as support, verifying me. Indeed, I fear that they will deny me.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَخِى", "translit": "àِhkَaʾَw", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَٰرُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُrَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَفْصَحُ", "translit": "ُḥَṣْfَaʾ", "root": "فصح"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لِسَانًا", "translit": "āًnāَsِl", "root": "لسن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَأَرْسِلْهُ", "translit": "ُhْlِsْrَaʾَf", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مَعِىَ", "translit": "َàِʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "رِدْءًا", "translit": "āًءْdِr", "root": "ردا"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "يُصَدِّقُنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnُqِّdَṣُy", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "إِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَخَافُ", "translit": "ُfāَhkَaʾ", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يُكَذِّبُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُbِّhdَkُy", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 35, "text": "قَالَ سَنَشُدُّ عَضُدَكَ بِأَخِيكَ وَنَجْعَلُ لَكُمَا سُلْطَٰنًا فَلَا يَصِلُونَ إِلَيْكُمَاۚ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ أَنتُمَا وَمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكُمَا ٱلْغَٰلِبُونَ ", "translation": "[Allāh] said, \"We will strengthen your arm through your brother and grant you both supremacy so they will not reach you. [It will be] through Our signs; you and those who follow you will be the predominant.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "سَنَشُدُّ", "translit": "ُّdُhsَnَs", "root": "شدد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَضُدَكَ", "translit": "َkَdُḍَʿع", "root": "عضد"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِأَخِيكَ", "translit": "َkyِhkَaʾِb", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَنَجْعَلُ", "translit": "ُlَʿعْjgَnَw", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَكُمَا", "translit": "āَmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "سُلْطَٰنًا", "translit": "āًnَٰṭْlُs", "root": "سلط"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَلَا", "translit": "āَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يَصِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِṣَy", "root": "وصل"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِلَيْكُمَا", "translit": "āَmُkْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnِtَٰyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَنتُمَا", "translit": "āَmُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَمَنِ", "translit": "ِnَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱتَّبَعَكُمَا", "translit": "āَmُkَʿعَbَّtٱ", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلْغَٰلِبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbِlَٰغْlٱ", "root": "غلب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 36, "text": "فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُم مُّوسَىٰ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا بَيِّنَٰتٍ قَالُوا۟ مَا هَٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحْرٌ مُّفْتَرًى وَمَا سَمِعْنَا بِهَٰذَا فِىٓ ءَابَآئِنَا ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ ", "translation": "But when Moses came to them with Our signs as clear evidences, they said, \"This is not except invented magic, and we have not heard of this [religion] among our forefathers.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَآءَهُم", "translit": "mُhَءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مُّوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا", "translit": "āَnِtَٰyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بَيِّنَٰتٍ", "translit": "ٍtَٰnِّyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هَٰذَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "سِحْرٌ", "translit": "ٌrْḥِs", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "مُّفْتَرًى", "translit": "àًrَtْfُّm", "root": "فري"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "سَمِعْنَا", "translit": "āَnْʿعِmَs", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "بِهَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "فِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ءَابَآئِنَا", "translit": "āَnِyʾٓāَbāَء", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَّwَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اول"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 37, "text": "وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ رَبِّىٓ أَعْلَمُ بِمَن جَآءَ بِٱلْهُدَىٰ مِنْ عِندِهِۦ وَمَن تَكُونُ لَهُۥ عَٰقِبَةُ ٱلدَّارِۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُفْلِحُ ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ ", "translation": "And Moses said, \"My Lord is more knowing [than we or you] of who has come with guidance from Him and to whom will be succession in the home.[1] Indeed, wrongdoers do not succeed.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَقَالَ", "translit": "َlāَqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَبِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَaʾ", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِمَن", "translit": "nَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "جَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِٱلْهُدَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَdُhْlٱِb", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عِندِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَكُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُkَt", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "عَٰقِبَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَbِqَٰʿع", "root": "عقب"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلدَّارِ", "translit": "ِrāَّdlٱ", "root": "دور"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "يُفْلِحُ", "translit": "ُḥِlْfُy", "root": "فلح"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 38, "text": "وَقَالَ فِرْعَوْنُ يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْمَلَأُ مَا عَلِمْتُ لَكُم مِّنْ إِلَٰهٍ غَيْرِى فَأَوْقِدْ لِى يَٰهَٰمَٰنُ عَلَى ٱلطِّينِ فَٱجْعَل لِّى صَرْحًا لَّعَلِّىٓ أَطَّلِعُ إِلَىٰٓ إِلَٰهِ مُوسَىٰ وَإِنِّى لَأَظُنُّهُۥ مِنَ ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ ", "translation": "And Pharaoh said, \"O eminent ones, I have not known you to have a god other than me. Then ignite for me, O Hāmān, [a fire] upon the clay[1] and make for me a tower that I may look at the God of Moses. And indeed, I do think he is among the liars.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَقَالَ", "translit": "َlāَqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنُ", "translit": "ُnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "translit": "āَhُّyَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمَلَأُ", "translit": "ُaʾَlَmْlٱ", "root": "ملا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَلِمْتُ", "translit": "ُtْmِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "لَكُم", "translit": "mُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِلَٰهٍ", "translit": "ٍhَٰlِiʾ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "غَيْرِى", "translit": "àِrْyَغ", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "فَأَوْقِدْ", "translit": "ْdِqْwَaʾَf", "root": "وقد"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "يَٰهَٰمَٰنُ", "translit": "ُnَٰmَٰhَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَ